<p>NOTES: In q4 1996 net pre-tax adjustments and nonrecurring charges were $26 million. These include $31 million adjustment to reserve for certain third-party accounts receivable and to increase allowance for doubtful accounts, nonrecurring income of $9 million from insurance claim; and nonrecurring charges and expenses of $4 million related to continuing litigation and investigation costs. In Q3 1996, the company recorded a nonrecurring charge of $24 million to settle certain securities class-action lawsuits filed in 1995.</p>
